        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie fantasy J-RPG totaling approx. 5 hours of gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet captivating heroines, each with their own distinct charm  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore nostalgic maps with Japanese gods, girls, and Yokai </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in battles to defeat Yokai and restore peace to the town!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use rare cards to deliver devastating damage to your enemies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Battle and Conquer the Yokai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic battles to defeat troublesome Yokai and restore peace to the town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collectible Yokai Cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the nostalgia of classic card games as you collect a wide array of Yokai cards! Store them in your collection and unleash unique abilities during battles. Use rare cards to deliver devastating damage to your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Diverse Female Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a vibrant cast of characters, including a police officer, a caring mom, a shrine maiden, and more! Each brings their own charm to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose Your Playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a quick playthrough? Just follow the Heart Marks! Prefer a deeper experience? Seek out all the Exclamation Marks to enjoy side stories and extra content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- System Requirements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed using RPG Maker MV. Please ensure your system meets RPG Maker MV’s requirements for optimal performance.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie fantasy J-RPG totaling approx. 5 hours of gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet captivating heroines, each with their own distinct charm  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore nostalgic maps with Japanese gods, girls, and Yokai </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in battles to defeat Yokai and restore peace to the town!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use rare cards to deliver devastating damage to your enemies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Battle and Conquer the Yokai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in epic battles to defeat troublesome Yokai and restore peace to the town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collectible Yokai Cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the nostalgia of classic card games as you collect a wide array of Yokai cards! Store them in your collection and unleash unique abilities during battles. Use rare cards to deliver devastating damage to your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Diverse Female Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a vibrant cast of characters, including a police officer, a caring mom, a shrine maiden, and more! Each brings their own charm to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose Your Playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a quick playthrough? Just follow the Heart Marks! Prefer a deeper experience? Seek out all the Exclamation Marks to enjoy side stories and extra content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- System Requirements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed using RPG Maker MV. Please ensure your system meets RPG Maker MV’s requirements for optimal performance.</p>",
        "short_description": "Yokai Busters is an indie fantasy J-RPG featuring a diverse cast of female characters. You'll find a police officer, a caring mom, a shrine maiden, and more! Explore the maps and have a blast battling with your favorite Japanese girls, and Yokai!",
